WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.784 --> 00:00:12.845
Recess was Henry's favorite part of the school day.

2
00:00:14.446 --> 00:00:17.407
He liked to chase the other kids around the playground.

3
00:00:17.427 --> 00:00:25.090
"Aaaaahhhhhh!" he screamed, making his scariest monster face.

4
00:00:27.331 --> 00:00:32.525
When the kids saw Henry coming, they would shout, "Here comes the monster!"

5
00:00:33.946 --> 00:00:36.147
Then they would run away screaming and giggling.

6
00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:46.093
Henry could be quite a few different monsters: a wolf, a gorilla, or a ghost.

7
00:00:47.553 --> 00:00:50.075
He tried hard to make each one scary.

8
00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:56.778
What Henry really wanted, though, was to play nicely like everyone else.

9
00:00:58.119 --> 00:01:01.921
He wanted to make sand castles or play catch with the other kids.

10
00:01:03.382 --> 00:01:06.464
But Henry was shy and talked in a quiet voice.

11
00:01:08.204 --> 00:01:10.866
He was always afraid the other kids would laugh at him.

12
00:01:12.187 --> 00:01:15.068
The only way he could play was by being a monster.

13
00:01:15.088 --> 00:01:19.631
"Oh, Henry, can't you play some other way?"

14
00:01:20.151 --> 00:01:21.472
Henry's teacher asked him.

15
00:01:23.653 --> 00:01:29.116
She tried showing him how to play in the sandbox, but Henry wasn't good at making sand castles.

16
00:01:30.572 --> 00:01:34.235
He always ended up throwing sand in other kids' faces by accident.

17
00:01:35.957 --> 00:01:38.459
One day, a new girl arrived at school.

18
00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:43.122
Henry saw her sitting alone in a corner, looking sad.

19
00:01:44.423 --> 00:01:45.364
He was curious.

20
00:01:45.384 --> 00:01:48.707
"Maybe I can make her run away from me.

21
00:01:49.367 --> 00:01:51.669
It might be fun," he thought.

22
00:01:53.151 --> 00:01:54.952
He decided to be the ghost.

23
00:01:57.394 --> 00:02:13.207
Slowly, he walked toward her, making scary faces and But she didn't even look at him.

24
00:02:14.628 --> 00:02:18.070
He got closer and beat his chest, grunting like a gorilla.

25
00:02:21.992 --> 00:02:23.553
She still did not move.

26
00:02:25.034 --> 00:02:28.916
Then he showed his teeth and screamed as loud as he could.

27
00:02:34.432 --> 00:02:36.254
The girl finally looked up at him.

28
00:02:37.595 --> 00:02:39.697
She giggled and then laughed out loud.

29
00:02:46.623 --> 00:02:47.944
Henry was confused.

30
00:02:49.165 --> 00:02:51.748
The next thing she did confused him even more.

31
00:02:53.129 --> 00:02:56.332
She opened her mouth wide and roared like a lion.

32
00:03:00.256 --> 00:03:02.237
This had never happened before!

33
00:03:03.637 --> 00:03:05.558
Kids were always scared of him!

34
00:03:06.338 --> 00:03:07.778
What was he supposed to do?

35
00:03:09.279 --> 00:03:11.899
The girl kept making funny faces and laughing.

36
00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:14.640
Then Henry laughed too.

37
00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.340
This was fun!

38
00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:20.022
"I like playing monster!"

39
00:03:20.522 --> 00:03:21.222
said the girl.

40
00:03:21.242 --> 00:03:25.143
"Do you want to see my wolf monster?"

41
00:03:25.783 --> 00:03:26.923
Henry asked proudly.

42
00:03:26.943 --> 00:03:33.053
"Sure!" Henry threw his head back and howled like a wolf.

43
00:03:33.073 --> 00:03:38.754
"Aooooo!" "Wow!

44
00:03:39.074 --> 00:03:40.075
Let me try."

45
00:03:41.395 --> 00:03:42.655
The girl howled too.

46
00:03:42.675 --> 00:03:46.056
"Aooooo! I'm Annie.

47
00:03:46.756 --> 00:03:47.657
What's your name?"

48
00:03:47.677 --> 00:03:53.178
"Henry." "I'm glad you're playing with me.

49
00:03:53.838 --> 00:03:55.999
Everyone else already has a friend."

50
00:03:58.099 --> 00:04:02.746
Then Henry shyly asked, "Do you want to be my friend?"

51
00:04:04.427 --> 00:04:06.468
Annie smiled and gave Henry a hug.

52
00:04:06.488 --> 00:04:09.370
"Yes! I'd love to be your friend!"

53
00:04:11.132 --> 00:04:11.912
Henry blushed.

54
00:04:11.932 --> 00:04:14.754
"Tag, you're it!"

55
00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:16.776
Annie yelled as she ran away.

56
00:04:18.757 --> 00:04:22.180
Henry and Annie chased each other happily around the playground.

57
00:04:23.421 --> 00:04:25.843
They took turns being the scariest monster.

58
00:04:27.184 --> 00:04:31.534
Then Annie taught Henry how to make sand castles in the sandbox.

59
00:04:33.334 --> 00:04:35.495
Henry's teacher was very happy.

60
00:04:36.096 --> 00:04:37.436
Henry was happy too.

61
00:04:38.897 --> 00:04:41.878
He did not have to be a monster all the time anymore.

62
00:04:43.099 --> 00:04:45.960
Now, he and Annie were best friends.
